  "title": "Oatmeal Chocolate Chip Lactation Cookies",
  "description": "These oatmeal-chocolate chip lactation cookies made with flaxseed, walnuts, and brewer's yeast are designed to increase a mother's milk supply for nursing.",
  "authors": [
    "Corey Jordan"
  ],
